    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Enhance your WooCommerce checkout experience with the Custom Fields Checkout Block! This powerful feature allows store owners to seamlessly add custom fields to the checkout page, providing flexibility and personalization to meet unique business requirements.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable/Disable</li>\n<li>There is 3 Option Available (Select , Text , Checkbox)</li>\n<li>Unlimted Field Can be add There</li>\n<li>There is 3 Location Available (Contact , Address , Order)</li>\n<li>Will show on Admin , Email </li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
